## 4. Slice summary

The exact \(n=2\) mathematics in W11 is genuinely characteristic-uniform: its count cells, residual censuses, recursive translations, and \(q^N\) drainage law use only finite-field counting, DVR valuations, and completeness. Extending its formal statement from the displayed unramified/equal-characteristic parenthetical to all complete DVRs is a trivial edit, with \(v(2)=1\) retained only for an optional discriminant-spectrum remark. W12’s elementary order-one digit calculus and its repaired separability arguments are likewise characteristic-free, and the new history-transfer formula contains no factorial, logarithmic, Witt-vector, or \(v(p)\) dependency. Nevertheless, this slice does not certify W12 at the requested generality: its Ore/GMN leaf certification is cited through a source whose verified published scope is \(K/\mathbb Q_p\), and W12-HT additionally consumes the unpasted `GENIND-1`. The standalone HUMAN_PROOF is more decisively mixed-characteristic-only: it fixes unramified \(K/\mathbb Q_p\), uses \(p\) as uniformizer, and relies on a characteristic-zero different/depth argument. Thus the exact finite-level evidence supports Asvin’s expectation, but these pasted notes as a whole do not yet prove “all complete DVRs, no new mathematics needed.”

